# Dependencies of the RKNN Toolkit Lite2 2.3.2 wheel (its Requires-Dist), plus OpenCV for
# Rockchip's examples. The wheel itself is installed --no-deps from versions.env.
# Its extension modules use numpy from Python only (no numpy C API), so numpy 2.x is fine.
# Regenerate the lock from armbian/userpatches/ with the command in its header, via mise.
numpy
psutil
ruamel.yaml
opencv-python-headless
